{
  "slug": "worldjen",
  "name": "Worldjen",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "WorldJen gives Claude a focused playbook for working with the WorldJen SDK, CLI, and runners. It helps install and verify the CLI, register and operate Linux runners, check run status and logs, and retrieve public leaderboard data using the documented public surface only.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `worldjen-bench` (Benchmark or evaluate an entire AI model), `worldjen-install` (Install or upgrade the WorldJen SDK and CLI in the active Python environment), `worldjen-leaderboard` (Fetch the public WorldJen leaderboard), `worldjen-rank` (Rank or compare several generated clips that share one prompt into a leaderboard), `worldjen-runner` (Set up and operate the WorldJen runner host — the GPU worker daemon that pulls evaluation jobs and…), `worldjen-score` (Score an individual generated clip, video, or image), `worldjen-update` (Upgrade the worldjen-skills plugin to the latest release)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install worldjen@claude-community` from `moonmath-ai/worldjen-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
